      "description": "Star Lion College of Engineering and Technology: a working engineering college campus in Thanjavur on 29 acres 79 cents, with about 1,11,158 sq ft of buildings, approved by AICTE and affiliated to Anna University, Chennai.\n\nBuilt-up area: ground floor 39,111 sq ft, first floor 36,227 sq ft, second floor 8,520 sq ft, labs 10,744 sq ft, workshop 10,708 sq ft, cafeteria 2,324 sq ft with a 1,097 sq ft open shed, car parking 2,073 sq ft, generator room 274 sq ft and watchman shed 80 sq ft.\n\nCourses currently approved, with yearly intake: B.E. Computer Science and Engineering (60), Mechanical Engineering (60), Civil Engineering (30), Electrical and Electronics Engineering (30), Electronics and Communication Engineering (30), Computer Science and Engineering with AI and Machine Learning (30), and B.Tech. Artificial Intelligence and Data Science (30), a total UG intake of 270; plus M.E. Structural Engineering (18).\n\nFacilities: 22 classrooms, 2 computer labs, a library of 12,672 volumes with 96 national and international journals and DELNET e-journals, a seminar hall, recreation and physical education rooms, separate rest rooms for boys and girls, and 2 buses. Each department has its own laboratories, including a CNC lab, CAD/CAM, thermal, heat transfer, surveying, soil mechanics, hydraulics, materials testing, power systems, power electronics, VLSI, communication systems, AI, machine learning and deep learning labs.\n\nPrice, title documents and the terms of transfer are shared on enquiry. Figures are from the college brochure and will be verified before a site visit.",
